{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600120","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1760012001:0":{"text":"Without delay, you make your way to the Lionheart Hunting Grounds, where Gwyneth is already waiting at the entrance...","source_cn":"时间紧迫，你们即刻赶往狮心猎场。格温妮丝已经在猎场门口...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A356C0903299FA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Without delay, you make your way to the Lionheart Hunting Grounds, where Gwyneth is already waiting at the entrance...","female":"Without delay, you make your way to the Lionheart Hunting Grounds, where Gwyneth is already waiting at the entrance...","variant_male_record_index":"238491","variant_female_record_index":"238492","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1760012002:1":{"text":"Everyone, it's an honor to have you as my allies today.","source_cn":"梅林阁下、科丝蒂，还有几位新朋友，很荣幸今日能与你们并...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD348750A43D4905","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Everyone, it's an honor to have you as my allies today.","female":"Everyone, it's an honor to have you as my allies today.","variant_male_record_index":"238493","variant_female_record_index":"238494","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760012003:1":{"text":"Before we begin, there's something important about Doomword Phantom I need to share with all of you.","source_cn":"在战斗开始前，我先向各位介绍一条有关禁忌言灵的重要情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AFF95F9307706AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760012004:1":{"text":"This Hypofiend moves unpredictably and is skilled at hiding its trail.","source_cn":"这头魔物行踪诡谲，善于隐藏踪迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDDFEC573A18C12C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760012005:1":{"text":"Once we're inside the hunting grounds, it could ambush us from any direction, so stay alert.","source_cn":"一旦我们进入猎场，它可能会从各个方向发起偷袭。请各位务...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA824AE423F4B73E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1760012006:1":{"text":"If everyone's ready, let's move out.","source_cn":"准备好了的话，我们就出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6AA9D35F95ECA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760012007:1":{"text":"As planned, you and Cassadee use detection magic to track Doomword Phantom's movements.","source_cn":"依照作战计划，你与科丝蒂同时使用探测魔法，标记出禁忌言...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCBCD8B224D0324","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"As planned, you and Cassadee use detection magic to track Doomword Phantom's movements.","female":"As planned, you and Cassadee use detection magic to track Doomword Phantom's movements.","variant_male_record_index":"238499","variant_female_record_index":"238500","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1760012008:1":{"text":"Guided by the detection magic, you move cautiously through the tall shrubs and dense undergrowth.","source_cn":"在探测魔法的指引下，你们谨慎地迈过高草、拨开草杆，一路向前。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8588B70E14FFA5C5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Guided by the detection magic, you move cautiously through the tall shrubs and dense undergrowth.","female":"Guided by the detection magic, you move cautiously through the tall shrubs and dense undergrowth.","variant_male_record_index":"238501","variant_female_record_index":"238502","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1760012009:1":{"text":"The once lively hunting grounds now lie eerily silent, with not a single animal in sight.","source_cn":"往日活跃的动物全都闭门不出，偌大的猎场陷入了死一样的寂静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6370B7E6921A28C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1760012010:1":{"text":"Without anyone noticing, a dimensional distortion emerges near Taichi.","source_cn":"在所有人都没有察觉到的地方，太一的身侧突然出现了一阵扭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE9C47CAFC6A3CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1760012011:1":{"text":"A dark-purple tail suddenly whips out of nowhere, striking viciously at Taichi. Only one person reacts.","source_cn":"一条深紫色的长尾凭空出现，充满恶意地袭向太一。在他本人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABEE2F7AFCCF53DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760012012:0":{"text":"Watch out!","source_cn":"——危险！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A84A49FFA3CCB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1760012013:0":{"text":"Yamato leaps forward and dives at Taichi, knocking him to the ground.","source_cn":"大和猛地跃起，用尽全身力气向前一扑，将太一重重地扑倒在地","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E0C5BF312DA7169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:1760012014:0":{"text":"The tail strikes at Yamato, barely missing his back...","source_cn":"那条长尾猛地抽向大和，险之又险地从他的背部擦过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CA0A2DDEE47F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760012015:1":{"text":"A pair of sinister eyes briefly appears in midair before vanishing again.","source_cn":"一双充满恶意的眼睛从虚空中浮现，而后又再次隐藏了身形。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x779A965C62BACE66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760012016:0":{"text":"This is the first attack by Doomword Phantom...","source_cn":"禁忌言灵，这头巨大如山般的魔物，终于发动了第一次攻击……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABCE0563551C750F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760012017:0":{"text":"The Hypofiend is here! Be prepared, everyone!","source_cn":"魔物出现了！各位，做好准备！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824F19D5D7D77D6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1760012018:0":{"text":"*Gasping for breath*","source_cn":"……呼……呼……<key:dialog187>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF79989BB75668C54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1760012019:0":{"text":"Yamato... thanks for that...","source_cn":"大和，你……谢谢你救了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA600E98F130CE83D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1760012020:0":{"text":"But... that was way too reckless! You could've been—","source_cn":"但……但你也太乱来了！如果刚刚没有躲开的话，你现在就已经——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B354A4EB9FF680A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1760012021:0":{"text":"I know you would've done the same for me!","source_cn":"一直在乱来的是你才对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F1EA2AE68937859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1760012022:1":{"text":"Taichi... you're not the only one who wants to protect our friends.","source_cn":"太一……你知不知道，不止你一个人想要保护同伴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F190DC43656564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1760012023:1":{"text":"Yamato, your voice is shaking... Are you okay?","source_cn":"大和，你的声音在发抖……你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81ECB2E305EDA528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1760012024:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1760012025:0":{"text":"To be honest, I'm a little scared.","source_cn":"太一，说实话，我有点害怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18DE24E998393E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1760012026:0":{"text":"Me too.","source_cn":"我也是。<key:dialog184>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA9DEBD33A125200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1760012027:0":{"text":"I could feel that Hypofiend's overwhelming power when it attacked me just now... It felt just like facing the Dark Masters.","source_cn":"那个怪物很强，它刚刚袭击我时，那种强大的压迫力……简直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC63F3C029A718B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1760012028:1":{"text":"I'm actually really scared...","source_cn":"说实话，我真的很害怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA25F1DA27E77FA41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1760012029:0":{"text":"But I thought about Gabumon, Agumon, and you... I knew I had to stay strong for my friends!","source_cn":"但是有加布兽，亚古兽和你在身边……有同伴在身边，我必须坚强！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ECA7F22C4268330","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:1760012030:0":{"text":"Enraged by its missed strike, Doomword Phantom lets out a furious roar. A purplish glow steadily intensifies in its mouth as it prepares for another attack...","source_cn":"魔物一击落空，恼怒地仰天长啸。深紫色的光芒在口中酝酿，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE56A32F22023504F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1760012031:0":{"text":"The problem is... my Crest still won't work.","source_cn":"可是……徽章还是没有反应。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1AC13C7C25000EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1760012032:0":{"text":"Anyway, it's still too early to give up.","source_cn":"但我们不会放弃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F2C6A473047D482","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1760012033:0":{"text":"Magister! Watch out!!!","source_cn":"梅林！那只魔物就快要——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3BDE16ED3B28B905","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister! Watch out!!!","female":"Magister! Watch out!!!","variant_male_record_index":"238526","variant_female_record_index":"238527","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1760012034:0":{"text":"<shk>Chippy!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>满满！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1DD83365F5D91D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1760012035:0":{"text":"The Hypofiend conjures a violent gust of wind and sends it straight at Chippy. Fortunately, you raise a magical barrier just in time to deflect the attack.","source_cn":"仿佛应和着漫漫的呼喊，魔物径直掀起气流，直击满满。好在...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D8D47690843A44E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Hypofiend conjures a violent gust of wind and sends it straight at Chippy. Fortunately, you raise a magical barrier just in time to deflect the attack.","female":"The Hypofiend conjures a violent gust of wind and sends it straight at Chippy. Fortunately, you raise a magical barrier just in time to deflect the attack.","variant_male_record_index":"238529","variant_female_record_index":"238530","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1760012036:0":{"text":"Yamato, it's time to show our might!","source_cn":"大和，也让它看看我们的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4585E660C7ACDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1760012037:0":{"text":"Let's do it! Our courage and friendship can overcome any darkness! This time, we'll win for sure!","source_cn":"没错。我相信保护同伴的勇气与友情能够突破所有黑暗，所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x360AF44D5242585C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1760012038:0":{"text":"As long as we stick together...","source_cn":"……是啊，只要我们在一起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F71CDD2AE559A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1760012039:0":{"text":"We're unbeatable!","source_cn":"……就一定可以做到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10361713B5A4D810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:55:1760012040:0":{"text":"At that critical moment, the two Crests suddenly emit a brilliant burst of light.","source_cn":"一阵强烈的光辉突然从两人胸前的吊坠中迸射","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF71881DFB6CFC4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:56:1760012041:1":{"text":"Moved by the boys' steadfast resolve, the Crest of Courage and Crest of Friendship shine once more.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD8C468B32859B01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:57:1760012042:1":{"text":"The radiance engulfs the entire hunting grounds, leaving Doomword Phantom nowhere to hide. It writhes and growls in pain...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x732A8BA57DC40A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1760012043:0":{"text":"Now! Are you ready, Agumon?","source_cn":"就是现在！亚古兽，准备好了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109FCA51F59D1BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1760012044:0":{"text":"I'm ready, Taichi!","source_cn":"准备好了，太一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CFA7BEB90578CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1760012045:0":{"text":"What about you, Gabumon?","source_cn":"加布兽，你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE9E515642A8DECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum